Subject: inject: build without the optional guice-servlet and CDI APIs

Both are looked up at run time and are absent from Maven's class path;
neither is packaged, so the code paths using them are compiled out.

---

--- a/org.eclipse.sisu.inject/src/main/java/org/eclipse/sisu/inject/Implementations.java
+++ b/org.eclipse.sisu.inject/src/main/java/org/eclipse/sisu/inject/Implementations.java
@@ -36,13 +36,8 @@
